		{"id":"n_ai","type":"text","text":"- [[artificial-intelligence-fundamentals|AI Fundamentals]] — Basics of AI, automation, and business intelligence\n- [[generative-ai-basics|Generative AI Basics]] — GenAI capabilities and technology ecosystem\n- [[large-language-models|Large Language Models]] — How Salesforce leverages LLMs\n- [[natural-language-processing-basics|NLP Basics]] — Language understanding and parsing\n- [[reasoning-in-artificial-intelligence|Reasoning in AI]] — Reasoning engines overview\n- [[atlas-reasoning-engine|Atlas Reasoning Engine]] — Multi-step decision loop that drives Agentforce agents\n- [[data-fundamentals-for-ai|Data Fundamentals for AI]] — Data quality, ethics, privacy, compliance [→ Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/data-fundamentals-for-ai/learn-about-data-and-ai)","x":595,"y":30,"width":510,"height":350},
		{"id":"n_platform","type":"text","text":"- [[agentforce-overview|Agentforce Overview]] — Core concepts, agent types, platform architecture\n- [[introduction-to-agentforce|Introduction to Agentforce]] — What jobs it performs vs traditional automation\n- [[autonomous-agents|Autonomous Agents]] — Capabilities, business transformation, trust mechanisms\n- [[agentforce-vs-einstein-bots|Agentforce vs Einstein Bots]] — Decision models, config, flexibility, use cases\n- [[data-ai-crm-quick-look|Data + AI + CRM]] — How Data Cloud, AI, and CRM form the 360 Platform\n- [[agentexchange-quick-look|AgentExchange]] — Marketplace for pre-built agents, topics, integrations","x":1175,"y":30,"width":510,"height":315},
		{"id":"n_setup","type":"text","text":"- [[agentforce-setup-sequence|Setup Sequence]] — 8-phase end-to-end journey (Foundation → Monitoring)\n- [[agentforce-basics|Agentforce Basics]] — Prerequisites, Agent / Topic / Action objects, admin setup\n- [[setup-with-agentforce-quick-look|Setup with Agentforce]] — Guided admin configuration inside Setup\n- [[agentforce-licensing|Licensing and Limits]] — ~$2 per conversation pricing, entitlements, governance","x":15,"y":30,"width":510,"height":265},
		{"id":"n_trust","type":"text","text":"- [[einstein-trust-layer|Einstein Trust Layer]] — Zero data retention, masking, toxicity detection, audit log\n- [[agentforce-trust-layer-module|Agentforce Trust Layer]] — Data masking, security controls, responsible AI governance\n- [[agentforce-security-and-permissions|Security and Permissions]] — Running user context, over-privileged agents, PII, prompt injection","x":1175,"y":540,"width":510,"height":225},
		{"id":"n_strategy","type":"text","text":"- [[ai-strategy|AI Strategy]] — Business vision, governance, risk, use-case prioritisation [→ Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/ai-strategy)\n- [[drive-ai-within-your-organisation|Drive AI in Your Organisation]] — Business cases, stakeholder alignment, governance, measurable outcomes\n- [[lead-the-way-with-ai|Lead the Way with AI]] — Agentblazer levels (Champion → Innovator → Legend), executive framing [→ Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/agentblazer-reflection)","x":1775,"y":30,"width":510,"height":245},
		{"id":"n_ref","type":"text","text":"- [[agentblazer-learning-path|Agentblazer Learning Path]] — Champion → Innovator → Legend module breakdown [→ Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/agentblazer)\n- [[agentforce-glossary|Agentforce Glossary]] — Alphabetical reference of all key terms and definitions\n- [[agentforce-practitioner-resources|Practitioner Resources]] — Curated links by theme: Strategy, Design, Technical Build, Deployment\n- [[agentforce-setup-sequence|Setup Sequence]] — 8-phase implementation journey with Trailhead links per phase","x":1775,"y":390,"width":510,"height":305},
		{"id":"n_dev","type":"text","text":"- [[agentforce-actions|Agentforce Actions]] — Flow, Apex, Prompt Template, MuleSoft action types and design principles\n- [[advanced-agent-customizations|Advanced Customizations]] — Prompt Builder + Flow + Apex patterns [→ Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/custom-service-agents-with-prompt-builder-and-agentforce)\n- [[develop-with-agentforce-tools|Dev with Agentforce Tools]] — Agentforce Vibes, Apex, AI-assisted development [→ Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/einstein-for-developers)\n- [[mcp-for-agentforce|MCP for Agentforce]] — Registry (register external servers), Gateway (usage policies), native MCP client [→ Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/mcp-for-agentforce-quick-look)","x":1175,"y":875,"width":510,"height":290},
		{"id":"n_service","type":"text","text":"- [[agentforce-for-service-module|Agentforce for Service]] — Autonomous customer support, Knowledge grounding, escalation to human\n- [[close-cases-faster-service-assistant|Service Assistant]] — AI-assist with suggested actions, reply drafts, case summaries\n- [[use-employee-agents|Employee Agents]] — Internal staff assistance use cases (Coral Cloud Resorts scenario)","x":15,"y":1280,"width":510,"height":235},
		{"id":"n_sales","type":"text","text":"- [[agentforce-for-sales-quick-look|Agentforce for Sales]] — SDR agent for outbound prospecting, Sales Coach for deal coaching\n- [[sell-smarter-with-agentforce|Sell Smarter with Agentforce]] — Lead nurturing, Sales Cloud pipeline integration [→ Trailhead](https://trailhead.salesforce.com/content/learn/modules/agentforce-sdr-setup-and-customization)","x":595,"y":1280,"width":510,"height":185},
